[1] (PDF) SOME OBSERVATIONS ON THE ICONOGRAPHY OF THE ‘RING OF NESTOR’         
https://www.academia.edu/83658257/SOME_OBSERVATIONS_ON_THE_ICONOGRAPHY_OF_THE_R
ING_OF_NESTOR_                                                                 

[2] (PDF) The Lord of the Gold Rings                                           
https://www.academia.edu/116392582/The_Lord_of_the_Gold_Rings                  

[3] Pylos - World History Encyclopedia https://www.worldhistory.org/Pylos      

[4] The Combat Agate from the Grave of the Griffin Warrior ...                 
https://www.aegeussociety.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Stocker-Davis-2017-Aga
te.pdf                                                                         

[5] COMBAT, MYTHS AND SEALS IN THE GRIFFIN ...                                 
https://journals.akademicka.pl/saac/article/download/1109/949/1786             

